# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Anthropic key is read from the environment (src/llm/client.py) and the Forge
# app stores it encrypted via `forge variables set --encrypt`. Nothing should ever
# land here, but fail safe.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
**/credentials.json

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/

# ── Node / Forge ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
.forge/
*.log
forge-app/static/panel/build/bundle.js
forge-app/scripts/.crosscheck.js

# ── Generated data & caches ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Corpora and LLM cache are large and reproducible; the evidentiary bundles
# (rag-formatter-results.zip, rag_formatter_v1.2_identity_REJECT.zip) and the
# results_v12/ outputs ARE tracked — they are the experimental record.
data/
cache/
results/runs/
*.faiss

# Cross-check working artifacts (§7.5). report.md is regenerated per run; archive
# a copy alongside a milestone if you want it preserved.
crosscheck/

# ── OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
